  "name": "Question 7",
  "problem": "Buying premium house paint costs $$156$ per gallon. What's the unit price per quart?\n\nAssume that there are $4$ quarts in one gallon.",
  "worked_solution": "First, notice that there are $4$ quarts in $1$ gallon. So, to find the unit price per quart, we divide the total price by $4:$\n\n$$\n156÷4=39\n$$\n\nTherefore, buying the paint costs $$39$ per quart.",
